    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Manager!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In whispering age you command your units by speaking with your managers, who then try... to fulfill your orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/805a50b5e65a14454827d24bfb03a91e.poster.avif?t=1753789819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/805a50b5e65a14454827d24bfb03a91e.webm?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/805a50b5e65a14454827d24bfb03a91e.mp4?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assign Tasks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell your managers to gather resources, construct structures, or defend the village. You'll at times need to calm your managers as civil war can break out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/7102944f87945b8d3e8b3013fe673507.poster.avif?t=1753789819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/7102944f87945b8d3e8b3013fe673507.webm?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/7102944f87945b8d3e8b3013fe673507.mp4?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build &amp; Defend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to survive by building, defending, and upgrading your units. Each playthrough is different and the AI (aka chatGPT) will always keep you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/159a8f314c887565592605496ee7d3e0.poster.avif?t=1753789819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/159a8f314c887565592605496ee7d3e0.webm?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/159a8f314c887565592605496ee7d3e0.mp4?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whispering Age: A Real-time Strategy Game with a Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Whispering Age, where your strategic prowess is tested not only by your decisions but also by your words. In this unique medieval real-time strategy game, you won't control your units directly. Instead, you'll communicate your commands to generals and managers, who will then relay your orders. Manage resources, build your empire, and defend your base against waves of enemies. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Command Manager!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In whispering age you command your units by speaking with your managers, who then try... to fulfill your orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/805a50b5e65a14454827d24bfb03a91e.poster.avif?t=1753789819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/805a50b5e65a14454827d24bfb03a91e.webm?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/805a50b5e65a14454827d24bfb03a91e.mp4?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assign Tasks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell your managers to gather resources, construct structures, or defend the village. You'll at times need to calm your managers as civil war can break out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/7102944f87945b8d3e8b3013fe673507.poster.avif?t=1753789819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/7102944f87945b8d3e8b3013fe673507.webm?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/7102944f87945b8d3e8b3013fe673507.mp4?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build &amp; Defend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to survive by building, defending, and upgrading your units. Each playthrough is different and the AI (aka chatGPT) will always keep you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/159a8f314c887565592605496ee7d3e0.poster.avif?t=1753789819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/159a8f314c887565592605496ee7d3e0.webm?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964220/extras/159a8f314c887565592605496ee7d3e0.mp4?t=1753789819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whispering Age: A Real-time Strategy Game with a Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Whispering Age, where your strategic prowess is tested not only by your decisions but also by your words. In this unique medieval real-time strategy game, you won't control your units directly. Instead, you'll communicate your commands to generals and managers, who will then relay your orders. Manage resources, build your empire, and defend your base against waves of enemies. </p>",
    "short_description": "Speak with your managers that relay commands to your units, which is powered by chatGPT. Instruct them to collect resources, build structures, and defend your base against waves of enemies. You will need to upgrade &amp; keep peace to survive! Alternatively... build your village up to tear it down!",
